德地，是其一短，不足以損其二長也。周公不求備於一人，故孤忘其短而貴其長，常以比方鄧禹也。又子明少時，孤謂不辭劇易，果敢有膽而已。及身長大，學問開益，籌略奇至，可以次於公瑾，但言議英發不及之耳。圖取關羽，勝於子敬。子敬答孤書云：『帝王之起，皆有驅除，羽不足忌。』此子敬內不能辦，外為大言耳，孤亦恕，不苟責也。然其作軍屯營，不失令行禁止，部界無廢負，路無拾遺，其法亦美也。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-lvmeng:line086:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"公瑾","kind":"person","person_id":"f56_938_997","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-lvmeng:line086:m0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"孟德","kind":"person","person_id":"dad_b77_b38","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-lvmeng:line086:m0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"公瑾","kind":"person","person_id":"f56_938_997","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-lvmeng:line086:m0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"子敬","kind":"person","person_id":"ooa_1fr_hy9","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-lvmeng:line086:m0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"孟德","kind":"person","person_id":"dad_b77_b38","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-lvmeng:line086:m0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"劉琮","kind":"person","person_id":"866_0fd_205_B","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-lvmeng:line086:m0103","start":103,"end":105,"surface":"子佈","kind":"person","person_id":"roi_rz4_ute","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-lvmeng:line086:m0106","start":106,"end":108,"surface":"文表","kind":"person","person_id":"2fy_jac_mju","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-lvmeng:line086:m0119","start":119,"end":121,"surface":"子敬","kind":"person","person_id":"ooa_1fr_hy9","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi